msgid "Revisión"
msgstr "Review"

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:37
msgid ""
"Al vencer la fecha de entrega, cada estudiante ve su corrección detallada y "
"las diapositivas de solución, durante el tiempo que se indique. Fuera de la "
"revisión, solo ve su puntaje."
msgstr ""
"Once the due date passes, each student sees their detailed correction and "
"the solution slides, for the period indicated. Outside the review, they only "
"see their score."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:44
msgid ""
"Con 0 días y las 00:00, la revisión se cierra al comenzar el día de la fecha "
"clave (por ejemplo, el de la prueba)."
msgstr ""
"With 0 days and 00:00, the review closes at the start of the key date's day "
"(for example, the test day)."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:51
msgid "Cierre del debate"
msgstr "Debate closing"

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:52
msgid ""
"Las preguntas de debate se discuten desde la fecha de entrega hasta este "
"cierre. Al cerrarse, los estudiantes ven su corrección y su explicación, "
"mientras dure la revisión."
msgstr ""
"Debate questions are discussed from the due date until this closing. When it "
"closes, students see their correction and their explanation, while the "
"review lasts."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:56
msgid ""
"Con este cierre, la corrección de las preguntas de debate se muestra cuando "
"termina la revisión, es decir, cuando ya no se ve. Si quiere que la vean "
"antes de la prueba, elija una fecha fija anterior o cierre el debate después "
"de discutirlo en clase."
msgstr ""
"With this closing, the correction of the debate questions is shown when the "
"review ends, that is, when it can no longer be seen. If you want students to "
"see it before the test, choose an earlier fixed date or close the debate "
"after discussing it in class."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:65
msgid ""
"Las entregas atrasadas se aceptan hasta el cierre del parcial y solo de "
"quienes no entregaron a tiempo."
msgstr ""
"Late submissions are accepted until the end of the term, and only from those "
"who did not submit on time."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:67
msgid ""
"Se califica el último intento enviado. Entre intentos, el estudiante ve su "
"puntaje; las soluciones se muestran en la revisión."
msgstr ""
"The last submitted attempt is graded. Between attempts the student sees "
"their score; the solutions are shown in the review."

#: templates/activities/_activity_settings.html:69
msgid ""
"Un borrador que no se envía no cuenta para la nota. Con esta opción, al "
"vencer la fecha se envía con lo que el estudiante tenga guardado, como "
"entrega a tiempo; si luego mueve la fecha de entrega hacia adelante, vuelve "
"a quedar abierto."
msgstr ""
"A draft that is not submitted does not count toward the grade. With this "
"option, at the due date it is submitted with whatever the student has saved, "
"as an on-time submission; if you later move the due date forward, it is "
"reopened."

